IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa28-part46`
IMPORT `coa28-sch1a`

-- coa28-tests-sch1a.l4: tests for coa28-sch1a.l4 (Schedule 1A, paragraphs 1 to 26). Every expected value was decided
-- by reading the paragraph named beside it, before running; none is copied from the encoding's output.

-- ---- Fixtures: ways of holding, and blocks
`coa28 test direct` MEANS `sch 1A para 2 held directly by X`
`coa28 test joint` MEANS `sch 1A para 11 held jointly by X and one or more others`
`coa28 test arrangement` MEANS `sch 1A para 12 held by another person who is party to a joint arrangement with X`
`coa28 test majority entity` MEANS `sch 1A para 18 held by a legal entity in which X has a majority stake, or by the last entity of a chain each of which has a majority stake in the next`
`coa28 test minority entity` MEANS `sch 1A para 18 held by a legal entity in which X has no majority stake`
`coa28 test nominee for X` MEANS `sch 1A para 19 held by another person as nominee for X`
`coa28 test X as nominee` MEANS `sch 1A para 19 held by X as nominee for another person`
`coa28 test right controlled by X` MEANS `sch 1A para 20 a right held by another person but controlled by X`
`coa28 test right controlled by another` MEANS `sch 1A para 20 a right held by X but controlled by another person`
`coa28 test security provided by X` MEANS `sch 1A para 23 rights attached to shares held by another by way of security provided by X, meeting paragraph 23(a) and (b)`
`coa28 test security held by X` MEANS `sch 1A para 23 rights attached to shares held by X by way of security provided by another, meeting paragraph 23(a) and (b)`
`coa28 test security provided by X, conditions not met` MEANS `sch 1A para 23 rights attached to shares held by another by way of security provided by X, not meeting paragraph 23(a) and (b)`
`coa28 test security conditions not met` MEANS `sch 1A para 23 rights attached to shares held by way of security, not meeting paragraph 23(a) and (b)`
`coa28 test another way` MEANS `sch 1A another way of holding`

-- Twelve blocks, one for each way of holding the Schedule distinguishes; amounts are nominal values.
`coa28 test blocks` MEANS LIST
    `sch 1A block` OF 20, `coa28 test direct`
    `sch 1A block` OF 10, `coa28 test joint`
    `sch 1A block` OF 5, `coa28 test nominee for X`
    `sch 1A block` OF 30, `coa28 test majority entity`
    `sch 1A block` OF 15, `coa28 test X as nominee`
    `sch 1A block` OF 8, `coa28 test minority entity`
    `sch 1A block` OF 7, `coa28 test another way`

-- ---- the block: which ways of holding count for X
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test direct`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test joint`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test arrangement`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test majority entity`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test minority entity`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test nominee for X`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test X as nominee`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test right controlled by X`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test right controlled by another`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test security provided by X`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test security held by X`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test security conditions not met`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test security provided by X, conditions not met`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the block is treated as held by X` (`sch 1A block` OF 1, `coa28 test another way`) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the amount counted: 20 direct + 10 joint + 5 held by a nominee for X + 30 through the majority-stake entity = 65;
-- the 15 that X holds as nominee for another and the 8 in the minority entity do not count; the 7 another way might.
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the amount counted as held by X` `coa28 test blocks` EQUALS 65
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the further amount that might be counted as held by X` `coa28 test blocks` EQUALS 7
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 11 to 23 the amount counted as held by X` EMPTY EQUALS 0

-- ---- para 11, 12
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 11 the person is treated as holding the share or right` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 11 the person is treated as holding the share or right` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 12(1) the person is treated as holding the combined shares or rights of both` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 12(1) the person is treated as holding the combined shares or rights of both` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- columns: an arrangement between the holders; to exercise all or substantially all rights jointly; in a pre-determined way
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 12(2) the arrangement is a joint arrangement` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 12(2) the arrangement is a joint arrangement` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 12(2) the arrangement is a joint arrangement` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 12(2) the arrangement is a joint arrangement` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- para 21 (and 12(3))
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 21(1) the thing is an arrangement` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 21(1) the thing is an arrangement` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 21(1) the thing is an arrangement` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 21(2) the thing counts as an arrangement` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 21(2) the thing counts as an arrangement` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 21 the thing is an arrangement for this Schedule` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 21 the thing is an arrangement for this Schedule` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 21 the thing is an arrangement for this Schedule` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 12(3) the thing is an arrangement as paragraph 21 gives the meaning` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 12(3) the thing is an arrangement as paragraph 21 gives the meaning` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- para 13: the amounts are nominal values; the whole is the issued share capital
-- 26 of 100 is more than 25%; 25 of 100 is not (the paragraph says "exceeding")
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(1) the person holds more than 25% of the shares in the legal entity that has a share capital` 26 0 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(1) the person holds more than 25% of the shares in the legal entity that has a share capital` 25 0 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(1) the person holds more than 25% of the shares in the legal entity that has a share capital` 20 5 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 25 counted and 1 that might be: the further block could take X over 25%, so not covered
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(1) the person holds more than 25% of the shares in the legal entity that has a share capital` 25 1 100 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(1) the person holds more than 25% of the shares in the legal entity that has a share capital` 20 6 100 EQUALS NOTHING
-- entity without a share capital
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(2)(a) the right is a holding of shares in the legal entity that does not have a share capital` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(2)(a) the right is a holding of shares in the legal entity that does not have a share capital` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(2)(a) the right is a holding of shares in the legal entity that does not have a share capital` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(2)(b) the person holds more than 25% of the shares in the legal entity that does not have a share capital` TRUE 0.9 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(2)(b) the person holds more than 25% of the shares in the legal entity that does not have a share capital` FALSE 0.26 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(2)(b) the person holds more than 25% of the shares in the legal entity that does not have a share capital` FALSE 0.25 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 13(2)(b) the person holds more than 25% of the shares in the legal entity that does not have a share capital` FALSE 0.25 0.01 EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- para 14, 15
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 14(1) the right is a voting right in the legal entity` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 14(1) the right is a voting right in the legal entity` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- columns: the entity has no general meetings that decide matters by voting; the right is equivalent to a person's voting rights in a company
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 14(2)(a) the right is a right of exercising voting rights in the entity` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 14(2)(a) the right is a right of exercising voting rights in the entity` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 14(2)(a) the right is a right of exercising voting rights in the entity` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 14(2)(b) the person exercises more than 25% of the voting rights in the entity` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 14(2)(b) the person exercises more than 25% of the voting rights in the entity` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 14(2)(b) the person exercises more than 25% of the voting rights in the entity` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 1,000 voting rights, of which the entity holds 100 itself: 900 count
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 15 the voting rights in the legal entity, reduced by the rights held by the entity itself` 1000 100 EQUALS 900

-- ---- paras 16, 17
-- a majority is more than half of the voting rights at board meetings
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 16 the person has the right to appoint or remove a majority of the board of directors` 51 0 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 16 the person has the right to appoint or remove a majority of the board of directors` 50 0 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 16 the person has the right to appoint or remove a majority of the board of directors` 50 1 100 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 17 the reference to a board of directors is read as a reference to the equivalent management body` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 17 the reference to a board of directors is read as a reference to the equivalent management body` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- ---- para 18
-- columns: majority of the voting rights; member and may appoint or remove a majority of the board; member and controls alone under an agreement; dominant influence
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(3) A has a majority stake in B` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(3) A has a majority stake in B` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(3) A has a majority stake in B` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(3) A has a majority stake in B` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(3) A has a majority stake in B` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(3)(a) A holds a majority of the voting rights in B` 51 100
#ASSERT NOT (`sch 1A para 18(3)(a) A holds a majority of the voting rights in B` 50 100)
-- columns: A has a majority stake in the entity; the entity holds the share; the entity is part of a chain whose last member holds it
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(1) the person holds the share indirectly` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(1) the person holds the share indirectly` (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(1) the person holds the share indirectly` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(1) the person holds the share indirectly` (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(1) the person holds the share indirectly` NOTHING TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(2) the person holds the right indirectly` (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(2) the person holds the right indirectly` (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(2) the person holds the right indirectly` (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(2) the person holds the right indirectly` (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(2) the person holds the right indirectly` NOTHING TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(4) the legal entity is treated as having the right to appoint the director` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(4) the legal entity is treated as having the right to appoint the director` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 18(4) the legal entity is treated as having the right to appoint the director` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- paras 19, 20
-- columns: held by a person as nominee for another; the person asked about is the person for whom it is held
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 19 the share is treated as held by the person` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 19 the share is treated as held by the person` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 19 the share is treated as held by the person` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 20(2) the person controls the right` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 20(2) the person controls the right` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 20(2) the person controls the right` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 20(2) the person controls the right` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- columns: the person controls it; the person in fact holds it; another person controls it
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 20(1) the right is treated as held by the person` (JUST TRUE) FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 20(1) the right is treated as held by the person` (JUST TRUE) TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 20(1) the right is treated as held by the person` (JUST FALSE) TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 20(1) the right is treated as held by the person` (JUST FALSE) FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 20(1) the right is treated as held by the person` NOTHING TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- para 22
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(3) the proceedings are relevant insolvency proceedings` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(3) the proceedings are relevant insolvency proceedings` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(3) the proceedings are relevant insolvency proceedings` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(3) the proceedings are relevant insolvency proceedings` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- columns: exercisable only in certain circumstances; circumstances have arisen and continue; circumstances within the control of the holder
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(1) the rights are taken into account` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(1) the rights are taken into account` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(1) the rights are taken into account` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(1) the rights are taken into account` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(2) the rights are taken into account even while the entity is in those proceedings` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(2) the rights are taken into account even while the entity is in those proceedings` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(2) the rights are taken into account even while the entity is in those proceedings` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(4) the rights continue to be taken into account` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 22(4) the rights continue to be taken into account` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- para 23
-- columns: held by way of security provided by the person; (a) exercisable only on the person's instructions; the loan limb; (b) exercisable only in the person's interests
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 23 the rights are treated as held by the person who provided the security` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 23 the rights are treated as held by the person who provided the security` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was NOTHING; limb (a) is a "where" condition and ruling (b) of 2026-11-05 answers JUST FALSE when a "where" fails
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 23 the rights are treated as held by the person who provided the security` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was NOTHING; the loan limb of (b) is a "where" condition (ruling (b))
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 23 the rights are treated as held by the person who provided the security` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was NOTHING; limb (b) is a "where" condition (ruling (b))
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 23 the rights are treated as held by the person who provided the security` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- para 24: guidance
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(1) the Secretary of State has issued the guidance` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(1) the Secretary of State has issued the guidance` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- columns: guidance has been issued; the question is the interpretation of "significant influence or control"
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(2) regard must be had to the guidance` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(2) regard must be had to the guidance` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(2) regard must be had to the guidance` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(3) the Secretary of State has laid a draft of the guidance before Parliament before issuing it` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(3) the Secretary of State has laid a draft of the guidance before Parliament before issuing it` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (7): the later of the days on which the draft is laid
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(7) the day on which the 40-day period begins` (Date 10 1 2025) (Date 12 1 2025) EQUALS Date 12 1 2025
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(7) the day on which the 40-day period begins` (Date 12 1 2025) (Date 10 1 2025) EQUALS Date 12 1 2025
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(7) the day on which the 40-day period begins` (Date 10 1 2025) (Date 10 1 2025) EQUALS Date 10 1 2025
-- (8): 40 days beginning with 1 January 2025 end on 9 February 2025; a dissolution of 10 to 14 January (5 days) moves it to 14 February
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(8) the last day of the 40-day period` (Date 1 1 2025) EMPTY EQUALS Date 9 2 2025
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(8) the last day of the 40-day period` (Date 1 1 2025) (LIST `s 1291(2) interval` OF (Date 10 1 2025), (Date 14 1 2025), `s 1291(2) Parliament dissolved or prorogued`) EQUALS Date 14 2 2025
-- (4): a resolution not to approve within the period (the 40th day, 9 February, is inside; 10 February is outside; 31 December is before)
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(4) the Secretary of State must take no further steps in relation to the draft` (Date 1 1 2025) EMPTY (JUST (Date 9 2 2025)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(4) the Secretary of State must take no further steps in relation to the draft` (Date 1 1 2025) EMPTY (JUST (Date 1 1 2025)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(4) the Secretary of State must take no further steps in relation to the draft` (Date 1 1 2025) EMPTY (JUST (Date 10 2 2025)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(4) the Secretary of State must take no further steps in relation to the draft` (Date 1 1 2025) EMPTY (JUST (Date 31 12 2024)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(4) the Secretary of State must take no further steps in relation to the draft` (Date 1 1 2025) EMPTY NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (5): no resolution within the period: the Secretary of State must issue and publish; before the period ends, not yet covered
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(5) the Secretary of State must issue and publish the guidance in the form of the draft` (Date 1 1 2025) EMPTY NOTHING (Date 10 2 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(5) the Secretary of State must issue and publish the guidance in the form of the draft` (Date 1 1 2025) EMPTY NOTHING (Date 9 2 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(5) the Secretary of State must issue and publish the guidance in the form of the draft` (Date 1 1 2025) EMPTY (JUST (Date 9 2 2025)) (Date 20 2 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(5) the Secretary of State must issue and publish the guidance in the form of the draft` (Date 1 1 2025) EMPTY (JUST (Date 10 2 2025)) (Date 20 2 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(6) sub-paragraph (4) prevents a new draft of proposed guidance from being laid before Parliament` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(6) sub-paragraph (4) prevents a new draft of proposed guidance from being laid before Parliament` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(9) the reference in paragraph 24 to guidance covers the guidance` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 24(9) the reference in paragraph 24 to guidance covers the guidance` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- para 25: limited partnerships
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(1) the individual meets the specified condition by virtue only of being a limited partner` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(1) the individual meets the specified condition by virtue only of being a limited partner` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(2) the individual meets the specified condition by virtue only of holding shares or a right in or in relation to a limited partner` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(2) the individual meets the specified condition by virtue only of holding shares or a right in or in relation to a limited partner` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(3) sub-paragraphs (1) and (2) apply` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(3) sub-paragraphs (1) and (2) apply` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(4) the individual is a limited partner for this paragraph` `sch 1A para 25(4)(a) a limited partner in a limited partnership registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 1907 who does not take part in the management of the partnership business` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(4) the individual is a limited partner for this paragraph` `sch 1A para 25(4)(a) a limited partner in a limited partnership registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 1907 who takes part in the management of the partnership business` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(4) the individual is a limited partner for this paragraph` `sch 1A para 25(4)(b) a foreign limited partner` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(4) the individual is a limited partner for this paragraph` `sch 1A para 25(4) another kind of partner` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- columns: participates in arrangements under the law of a country or territory outside the United Kingdom; has the prescribed characteristics
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(5) the individual is a foreign limited partner` TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(5) the individual is a foreign limited partner` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(5) the individual is a foreign limited partner` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(5) the individual is a foreign limited partner` FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 25(7) the procedure for regulations under paragraph 25` EQUALS `s 1290 affirmative resolution procedure`
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 26(3) the procedure for regulations under paragraph 26` EQUALS `s 1290 affirmative resolution procedure`
-- gathering: the condition, then 25(1) and 25(2)
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 2 to 4 and 25 the individual meets the specified condition` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 2 to 4 and 25 the individual meets the specified condition` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 2 to 4 and 25 the individual meets the specified condition` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A paras 2 to 4 and 25 the individual meets the specified condition` NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- Part 1: the five conditions
-- First condition: more than 25% of the shares. The blocks give 65 counted and 7 that might be; the whole is 200, 260 or 300.
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 2 the first condition is met` TRUE 65 7 200 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 2 the first condition is met` TRUE 65 7 260 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 2 the first condition is met` TRUE 65 7 300 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an entity with no share capital: amounts are fractions of the capital or profits
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 2 the first condition is met` FALSE 0.3 0 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 2 the first condition is met` FALSE 0.25 0 1 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the same, in per cent of a whole of 100: 30 is more than 25% and 25 is not
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 2 the first condition is met` FALSE 30 0 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 2 the first condition is met` FALSE 25 0 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 2 the first condition is met` FALSE 25 1 100 EQUALS NOTHING
-- Second condition: more than 25% of the voting rights, after para 15. Columns: the entity has general meetings; counted; might be; the voting rights, reduced; the blocking right
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 3 the second condition is met` TRUE 65 7 200 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 3 the second condition is met` TRUE 65 7 260 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 3 the second condition is met` TRUE 65 7 300 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 3 the second condition is met` FALSE 0 0 100 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 3 the second condition is met` FALSE 90 0 100 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Third condition: the answer of paragraph 16
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 4 the third condition is met` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 4 the third condition is met` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 4 the third condition is met` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- Fourth condition: the right to exercise, or actually exercising, significant influence or control
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 5 the fourth condition is met` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 5 the fourth condition is met` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 5 the fourth condition is met` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Fifth condition: (a) the trustees or firm members meet another condition, and (b) X has influence over the trust or firm
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 6 the fifth condition is met` (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 6 the fifth condition is met` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 6 the fifth condition is met` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 6 the fifth condition is met` NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 6 the fifth condition is met` NOTHING FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Paragraph 1: at least one of the five conditions must be met by an individual
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 1 at least one of the specified conditions is met by X in relation to company Y` TRUE (LIST (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 1 at least one of the specified conditions is met by X in relation to company Y` TRUE (LIST (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 1 at least one of the specified conditions is met by X in relation to company Y` TRUE (LIST (JUST FALSE), NOTHING, (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 1 at least one of the specified conditions is met by X in relation to company Y` FALSE (LIST (JUST TRUE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---- Part 2
-- columns: trustees or firm members hold an interest in a way mentioned in (1)(a) to (d); V has influence over the trust or firm
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 8(2) this sub-paragraph is satisfied` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 8(2) this sub-paragraph is satisfied` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 8(2) this sub-paragraph is satisfied` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- columns: (a) shares; (b) voting rights; (c) right to appoint or remove; (d) influence or control; (e) sub-paragraph (2)
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 8(1) V holds an interest in company W` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 8(1) V holds an interest in company W` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 8(1) V holds an interest in company W` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 8(1) V holds an interest in company W` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 8(1) V holds an interest in company W` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 8(1) V holds an interest in company W` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 8(1) V holds an interest in company W` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- columns: V holds an interest by virtue of indirectly holding shares or a right; V has a majority stake in L or in an entity in a chain that includes L
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 9(1) paragraph 9 applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 9(1) paragraph 9 applies` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 9(1) paragraph 9 applies` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 9(2) V holds the interest in company W through the legal entity` (JUST TRUE) `sch 1A para 9(2)(a) the legal entity L which holds the shares or right directly` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 9(2) V holds the interest in company W through the legal entity` (JUST TRUE) `sch 1A para 9(2)(b) each other legal entity in the chain` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 9(2) V holds the interest in company W through the legal entity` (JUST TRUE) `sch 1A para 9(2) a legal entity outside the chain` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 9(2) V holds the interest in company W through the legal entity` (JUST FALSE) `sch 1A para 9(2)(a) the legal entity L which holds the shares or right directly` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 1A para 9(2) V holds the interest in company W through the legal entity` NOTHING `sch 1A para 9(2)(a) the legal entity L which holds the shares or right directly` EQUALS NOTHING
